{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"screen\":\"像滚烫气息交织着幻想遗憾与快感，把人卷进温热漩涡，越陷越深\",\"source\":\"这股热度还有一种舍不得抽身的快感。它有一点情色性的暖意；你明知道自己正在被卷进去，却暂时不想出来。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿这一段写的是情色暖意和不愿抽身的快感，屏幕稿另加“幻想、遗憾”，使这一刻多出原段没有的遗憾情绪。\"},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"screen\":\"喉咙发紧，眼眶滚烫，嘴角高高扬着却掉下泪来\",\"source\":\"又可以是喉咙发紧、眼眶湿润，快乐到连自己想笑还是想哭都分不清。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿保留了笑还是哭都分不清的未定状态，屏幕稿则具体写成已经掉泪，替原本暧昧的反应作了确定选择。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "76b556a3-50c8-483d-812c-2fc405de02cb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T222102167320Z", "elapsed_seconds": 271.063, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T22:25:33.243907+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ba0514b47279e251a7730e8c510ff98ede6360bea93a2aa857489c1866cc808f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha